  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Trade your Colorful Screws\nfor Canari plush here! <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007200610064006500200079006F0075007200200043006F006C006F007200660075006C0020005300630072006500770073000A0066006F0072002000430061006E00610072006900200070006C007500730068002000680065007200650021002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, if you’ve got some Colorful Screws, I’ll trade\nyou a Canari plush for ’em.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s trade!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200074007200610064006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, thanks",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020007400680061006E006B00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Red Canari Plush, eh? I hear those help you get\nmore Exp. Points.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020005200650064002000430061006E00610072006900200050006C007500730068002C002000650068003F0020004900200068006500610072002000740068006F00730065002000680065006C007000200079006F00750020006700650074000A006D006F007200650020004500780070002E00200050006F0069006E00740073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Gold Canari Plush, eh? I hear those help you\nearn more money.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100200047006F006C0064002000430061006E00610072006900200050006C007500730068002C002000650068003F0020004900200068006500610072002000740068006F00730065002000680065006C007000200079006F0075000A006500610072006E0020006D006F007200650020006D006F006E00650079002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Pink Canari Plush, eh? I hear those help you\nfind more Mega Shards.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041002000500069006E006B002000430061006E00610072006900200050006C007500730068002C002000650068003F0020004900200068006500610072002000740068006F00730065002000680065006C007000200079006F0075000A00660069006E00640020006D006F007200650020004D0065006700610020005300680061007200640073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Green Canari Plush, eh? I hear those help you\nwithstand more hits from Pokémon.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Blue Canari Plush, eh? I hear those help you\ncatch Pokémon more easily.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100200042006C00750065002000430061006E00610072006900200050006C007500730068002C002000650068003F0020004900200068006500610072002000740068006F00730065002000680065006C007000200079006F0075000A0063006100740063006800200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006D006F0072006500200065006100730069006C0079002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, now. Why’d you come talk to me, then?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002C0020006E006F0077002E00200057006800792019006400200079006F007500200063006F006D0065002000740061006C006B00200074006F0020006D0065002C0020007400680065006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And hey—with that, you now own every single\nCanari plush I had to trade!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHere’s some fresh, exciting info for a plush-head\nlike yourself, then.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf you bring me every last Colorful Screw still out\nthere, I’ll reward you with a giant Canari plush!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 252
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wanna know how many Colorful Screws are left?\nHm... Seems there<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁ<U+0004>Ї’s just are <U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0004> more out there!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBring me all of ’em and I’ll let you trade the whole\nbunch for a giant Canari plush!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 189
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Jumpin’ Jolteon! You went and brought me every\nlast Colorful Screw there was to find!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThat’s deserving of a giant Canari plush for sure.\nI’ll go ahead and have it delivered to your room.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 190
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The giant Canari plush was sent to your room in\nHotel Z!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650020006700690061006E0074002000430061006E00610072006900200070006C0075007300680020007700610073002000730065006E007400200074006F00200079006F0075007200200072006F006F006D00200069006E000A0048006F00740065006C0020005A00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ve already got all the Canari plush, so I don’t\nthink there’s anything else I can help you with...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come see me if you’ve got more Colorful Screws\nthan ya know what to do with!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s a shocking amount of Canari-themed merch.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200061002000730068006F0063006B0069006E006700200061006D006F0075006E00740020006F0066002000430061006E006100720069002D007400680065006D006500640020006D0065007200630068002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’re plush dolls of the Pokémon Eelektross.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065007920190072006500200070006C00750073006800200064006F006C006C00730020006F0066002000740068006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000450065006C0065006B00740072006F00730073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon battles and video games are both great,\ndon’t you think? Even kids can get a taste of glory<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwhen they win against adults.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s important to give out estimates in writing.\nVerbal agreements just don’t cut it!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Turnin’ regular screws into Colorful Screws takes\na lot more finesse than you may think!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The whole point of our scaffolding courses is to\ngive folks in Lumiose a little fun!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, if it ain’t the Canari Quiz Whiz h<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂimerself! Yer\ngonna be runnin’ the quiz on yer own soon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I started usin’ that hologram of Canari to shield\nher from any weirdo fans, but before I knew it...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI’d gotten hooked on playin’ the part!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Those Colorful Screws are our way of havin’ fun—\nand spreadin’ it around too!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nGive folks a chance to make happy memories, and\nthey’ll come to love this city even more.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 175
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Looks like we’ve got a big job comin’ up!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 5000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F006F006B00730020006C0069006B006500200077006520190076006500200067006F00740020006100200062006900670020006A006F006200200063006F006D0069006E2019002000750070002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want the whole world to become fans of my\nscaffolding courses—er, I mean, fans of Canari!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 5092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Some fans get real excited over Pops’s hologram\nof me. Honestly, I’ve got mixed feelings about it...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 5284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I feel for G-Volt. She’s the type that’s always\ncarryin’ the world on her shoulders, y’know?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 5496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey. You. Fun fact: most streamers don’t like folks\npeekin’ at their monitors.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 5692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Folks in Lumiose ain’t gonna be too happy if you\nkeep sleepin’ on the whole Prism Tower dealio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 5860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "DYN4MO’s my way of makin’ Lumiose more fun.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 6060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440059004E0034004D004F201900730020006D007900200077006100790020006F00660020006D0061006B0069006E20190020004C0075006D0069006F007300650020006D006F00720065002000660075006E002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    }
  ],
